---
<ProductLayout title={page.title} hreflang={hreflang} description={page.description} canonical={page.canonical} ogImage="/images/Dinweys-Black-Sesome-processing.jpg" gallery={gallery} category={category} price={price} related={related} descriptionHtml={`<p>Our black sesame, with its thin skin, rich black color, high oil content, and crisp texture, is good for food processing and bakery.</p><h3>Key Indicators of Black Sesame</h3><table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;"><thead><tr style="border: 2px solid black;"><th style="border: 2px solid black; padding: 10px;">Indicator</th><th style="border: 2px solid black; padding: 10px;">Premium Standard</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style="border: 2px solid black;"><td style="border: 2px solid black; padding: 10px;">Kernel Purity Rate</td><td style="border: 2px solid black; padding: 10px;">≥99.99%</td></tr><tr style="border: 2px solid black;"><td style="border: 2px solid black; padding: 10px;">Impurity Content</td><td style="border: 2px solid black; padding: 10px;">≤1.0%</td></tr><tr style="border: 2px solid black;"><td style="border: 2px solid black; padding: 10px;">Moisture Content</td><td style="border: 2px solid black; padding: 10px;">≤7%</td></tr><tr style="border: 2px solid black;"><td style="border: 2px solid black; padding: 10px;">Oil Content</td><td style="border: 2px solid black; padding: 10px;">≥50.0%</td></tr><tr style="border: 2px solid black;"><td style="border: 2px solid black; padding: 10px;">Color and Odor</td><td style="border: 2px solid black; padding: 10px;">Jet black, bright, normal smell, with a unique aroma</td></tr><tr style="border: 2px solid black;"><td style="border: 2px solid black; padding: 10px;">Acid Value</td><td style="border: 2px solid black; padding: 10px;">≤5 mgKOH/g</td></tr><tr style="border: 2px solid black;"><td style="border: 2px solid black; padding: 10px;">Peroxide Value</td><td style="border: 2px solid black; padding: 10px;">≤0.3%</td></tr><tr style="border: 2px solid black;"><td style="border: 2px solid black; padding: 10px;">Heavy Metal Content</td><td style="border: 2px solid black; padding: 10px;">Meets national standards, such as arsenic and lead</td></tr></tbody></table>`} />
